00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,300
The grid is broken. The energy cascade never reaches the scale recorded in the original future.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:20,900
But the signal survived in the last captured data. It was not generated by the reactor. It was being received by it. And its timestamp is older than the project itself.

3
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:27,700
New coordinates. Civitas Network. 2100. The next target controls how the world makes decisions.
